---

### 4. LONG-PRESS DIALOG/MENU IMPLEMENTATION

**File:** `/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-114/app/src/main/java/com/simon/harmonichackernews/CommentsFragment.java`

**Method:** `onItemClick(Comment comment, int pos, View view)` - Lines 1375-1476

- Implements `CommentsRecyclerViewAdapter.CommentClickListener` interface (line 520 shows callback setup)
- Creates a Material AlertDialog with multiple menu options:
  - View user profile (line 1424)
  - Share comment link (line 1428)
  - Copy text (line 1433)
  - Select text (line 1442)
  - Vote up/down/unvote (lines 1446, 1450, 1454)
  - Reply to comment (lines 1463-1468)

---

### 5. URL OPENING LOGIC

**File:** `/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-114/app/src/main/java/com/simon/harmonichackernews/utils/Utils.java`

**Method:** `openLinkMaybeHN(Context context, String href)` - Lines 574-594

- Validates if the link is a Hacker News item (host: `news.ycombinator.com`, path: `/item`)
- If it's a HN link with valid ID parameter, opens the Comments activity for that item (line 587)
- Otherwise, launches the link in a custom tab or browser (line 593)

**Method:** `launchCustomTab(Context ctx, String url, boolean shareable)` - Lines 370-422

- Attempts to open URL in Chrome Custom Tabs with configured toolbar color
- Falls back to external browser if custom tabs not supported
- Includes URL parsing and fallback handling for malformed URLs

**Method:** `launchInExternalBrowser(Context ctx, String url)` - Lines 424-446

- Opens URL using standard Intent.ACTION_VIEW
- Includes retry logic for URL parsing

---

