- Abstract class for handling clicks on HTML table elements
- Stores raw table HTML for custom rendering

**File:** `/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-114/app/src/main/java/org/sufficientlysecure/htmltextview/DrawTableLinkSpan.java`

