### 8. USER DIALOG LINK HANDLING

**File:** `/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-114/app/src/main/java/com/simon/harmonichackernews/UserDialogFragment.java`

